    "de": [
      "Im Herzen des Viertels Le Village (Les 2 Alpes 1800) Fußgängerzone, in der Nähe von Geschäften und Freizeitmöglichkeiten, in der Nähe der Skilifte (Sessellift Village 2 Alpes 1800)"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Located in the heart of the Le Village (Les 2 Alpes 1800), close to shops and leisure activities, close to ski lifts (2 Alpes 1800 village chairlift)"
    ],
    "it": [
